{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-metador-defender-fire-doorsets-2512-0236","content_id":"4f7e353b-7768-4d32-b8d7-91c8268c7673","description":"Product Safety Report for Metador Defender Fire Doorsets.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"e7dd5e1d-eca1-4300-af3e-5753efc341ac","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-03-27T15:48:46+00:00","id":"e7dd5e1d-eca1-4300-af3e-5753efc341ac","title":"Link to PDF","updated_at":"2026-03-27T15:48:46+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69c6a6ddb66ff902f454438f/2512-0236-product-safety-report-metador-defender.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Metador Defender Fire Doorsets</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The fire performance of the doorsets cannot be guaranteed when used in an external location.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action:  The Office for Product Safety and Standards has required all companies trading as Metador to inform the supply chain, distributors and final consumers (where known) of the risks posed by this product.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Construction Products - Doorsets</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Metador</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Models</td>\n      <td>Defender Fireshield, Defender Inox, Defender Module X, Defender PASGuard, Defender Soundguard placed on the market between 2nd November 2019 and 30th May 2025. Metador products with these names placed on the market after 30th May 2025 are not affected.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>United Kingdom</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Steel doorset for internal or external use with optional fire-rating for internal use only. External in this context means that the doorset is open to the elements on one side.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_e7dd5e1d-eca1-4300-af3e-5753efc341ac\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69c6a6ddb66ff902f454438f/2512-0236-product-safety-report-metador-defender.pdf\">Link to PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The doorsets were marketed, labelled and/or listed on a declaration of performance as being suitable for external use (EN 14351-1), and also marketed and/or labelled as providing fire resistance characteristics. However, they had not been manufactured and conformity marked in accordance with the required level of independent oversight and testing for use as external doorsets claiming fire performance (under the harmonised standard EN 16034:2014). This means that these doorsets do not meet the regulatory requirements to declare fire resistance characteristics for use in an external location.</p>\n\n<p>The products do not meet the requirements of Regulation 305/2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The Office for Product Safety and Standards has required all companies trading as Metador to inform the supply chain, distributors and final consumers (where known) of the risks posed by this product.</p>\n\n<p>The potential impact of being unable to guarantee the performance of a product in relation to fire resistance and building safety will vary on a project-by-project basis and will depend on factors unique to each building. Building owners should seek advice from their building safety officer, an independent inspector, fire safety officer or a relevant building control authority, as appropriate, and consider reviewing the building’s fire strategy if necessary.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2512-0236</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"Dates added for the placing of the product on the market. ","public_timestamp":"2026-03-27T15:49:26Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-01-07T13:26:54Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"construction-products","product_measure_type":["other"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-01-07","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-01-07T13:26:54+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-metador-defender-fire-doorsets-2512-0236","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-metador-defender-fire-doorsets-2512-0236","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-metador-defender-fire-doorsets-2512-0236","content_id":"4f7e353b-7768-4d32-b8d7-91c8268c7673","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-03-27T15:49:26Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: Metador Defender Fire Doorsets (2512-0236)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-metador-defender-fire-doorsets-2512-0236","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","conten